  "solution": "Follow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below, \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2036b1be44489e4afa8f8948f7879561ecb8367b4b5baa2ed5885dcdaef64e4e.png] \n\n**Given:**\n\n(3)/(8) + (1)/(7) × 1 (3)/(4) + ( (2)/(3) ÷ (3)/(10) of (4)/(9) ) - ( 3 (1)/(5) ÷ 4 (1)/(2) of 5 (1)/(3) ) × (15)/(8)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(3)/(8) + (1)/(7) × 1 (3)/(4) + ( (2)/(3) ÷ (3)/(10) of (4)/(9) ) - ( 3 (1)/(5) ÷ 4 (1)/(2) of 5 (1)/(3) ) × (15)/(8)\n\n⇒ 3/8 + 1/7 × 7/4 + (2/3 ÷ 3/10 × 4/9) - (16/5 ÷ 9/2 × 16/3) × 15/8 \n\n⇒ 3/8 + 1/4 + (2/3 ÷ 3/10 × 4/9) - (16/5 ÷ 9/2 × 16/3) × 15/8 \n\n⇒ 3/8 + 1/4 + (2/3 × 15/2) - (16/5 × 1/24) × 15/8\n\n⇒ 3/8 + 1/4 + 5 - 2/15 × 15/8 \n\n⇒ 3/8 + 1/4 + 5 - 1/4 \n\n⇒ 5 + 3/8 \n\n⇒ 5 (3)/(8)\n\n**∴ The required result is 5 (3)/(8).**\n\n63:T84",
